event: message
data: {"result":{"tools":[{"name":"get_market_data_by_type","description":"Obtiene datos de mercado por tipo para un s\u00EDmbolo de equity. Devuelve precio, volumen y datos fundamentales.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo del equity (ej: AAPL, MSFT, TSLA)","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_gamma_exposure","description":"Calcula Gamma Exposure (GEX) por strike para un s\u00EDmbolo. Usa una sola conexi\u00F3n WebSocket para obtener OI e IV de todas las opciones de la expiraci\u00F3n regular m\u00E1s cercana (hasta 60 DTE), y calcula Greeks con Black-Scholes. Devuelve GEX por strike, delta, gamma, OI, y el nivel Gamma Zero.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo del subyacente (ej: AAPL, MSFT, SPY)","type":"string"},"minDelta":{"description":"Delta m\u00EDnimo absoluto para filtrar strikes (default: 0.10)","type":"number"},"maxDTE":{"description":"M\u00E1ximo DTE para filtrar expiraciones regulares (default: 60)","type":"integer"}},"required":["symbol","minDelta","maxDTE"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_implied_volatility","description":"Calcula la volatilidad impl\u00EDcita de un s\u00EDmbolo v\u00EDa REST market-metrics. Devuelve IV30_9d (9 d\u00EDas DTE), IV30_30d (30 d\u00EDas DTE) e IV30_90d (90 d\u00EDas DTE) interpolados desde expirationImpliedVolatilities, junto con IV30_0d e IV30_5d para calcular IV30RocPct (tasa de cambio 5 sesiones).","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo del subyacente (ej: AAPL, MSFT, SPY)","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_market_data_greeks","description":"Obtiene los Greeks actuales (Delta, Gamma, Theta, Vega, Rho, IV) para un s\u00EDmbolo de opci\u00F3n via WebSocket DXLink.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo de opci\u00F3n en formato OCC de 21 caracteres","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_market_data_candle","description":"Obtiene candles hist\u00F3ricos (OHLCV) para una opci\u00F3n. Incluye volatilidad impl\u00EDcita y Greeks calculados (Delta, Gamma, Theta) via Black-Scholes.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo de opci\u00F3n en formato OCC de 21 caracteres (ej: AAPL  250815C00215000)","type":"string"},"interval":{"description":"Intervalo de las candles: d (diario), 1h, 30m, 15m, 5m, 1m","type":"string"},"fromTime":{"description":"Fecha desde en formato yyyy-MM-dd","type":"string"},"toTime":{"description":"Fecha hasta en formato yyyy-MM-dd (opcional, si no se indica trae hasta hoy)","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol","interval","fromTime","toTime"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_option_chains","description":"Obtiene la cadena de opciones (option chain) para un s\u00EDmbolo. Incluye todas las expiraciones y strikes disponibles.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo del subyacente (ej: AAPL, MSFT)","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_market_data_quote","description":"Obtiene la cotizaci\u00F3n actual (bid/ask/mid) para un s\u00EDmbolo de opci\u00F3n via WebSocket DXLink.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo de opci\u00F3n en formato OCC de 21 caracteres","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_iv_rank","description":"Calcula IV Rank e IV Percentile de un s\u00EDmbolo usando los \u00FAltimos 252 trading days. Devuelve IV actual, m\u00E1xima, m\u00EDnima, IV Rank, IV Percentile y el historial diario de IV con precio de cierre.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo del subyacente (ej: AAPL, MSFT, SPY)","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_market_data_trade","description":"Obtiene el \u00FAltimo trade (precio, volumen, direcci\u00F3n) para un s\u00EDmbolo via WebSocket DXLink.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo del equity o opci\u00F3n en formato OCC","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}},{"name":"get_trade_quote_greeks","description":"Obtiene Trade \u002B Quote \u002B Greeks en una sola llamada optimizada (una sola conexi\u00F3n WebSocket). Greeks se incluye solo si el s\u00EDmbolo es una opci\u00F3n.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"symbol":{"description":"S\u00EDmbolo del equity o opci\u00F3n en formato OCC","type":"string"}},"required":["symbol"]},"execution":{"taskSupport":"optional"}}]},"id":2,"jsonrpc":"2.0"}

